  "FriendlyName": "PEPPickup",
  "Description": "Optional integration between PEPInventory and PEPInteraction: a world item actor pickable through PEPInteraction. Include only in projects that want this pickup convention; PEPInventory and PEPInteraction remain usable independently without it.",
